    "move_object": {
      "description": "Asignar un movimiento programable a un objeto. Reemplaza el motion anterior. type=stop detiene todo. Tipos: waypoints (interpola entre points a speed, loop), dynamic (velocity+gravity+expire_at), orbit (center+radius+axis+angular_speed), parametric (expresiones x/y/z evaluadas con t, namespace seguro sin builtins), rotate (angular_velocity continua). Los motions cinemáticos (waypoints/orbit/parametric/rotate) ignoran la física de colisión contra el grid; solo dynamic cae y colisiona.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "object_id": { "type": "integer" },
          "motion": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "type + campos según tipo. Ver descripción de la tool.",
            "properties": {
              "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["waypoints", "dynamic", "orbit", "parametric", "rotate", "stop"] },
              "points": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "number" }, "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3 } },
              "speed": { "type": "number" },
              "loop": { "type": "boolean" },
              "velocity": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "number" }, "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3 },
              "gravity": { "type": "boolean" },
              "expire_at": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
              "center": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "number" }, "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3 },
              "radius": { "type": "number" },
              "axis": { "type": "string", "enum": ["x", "y", "z"] },
              "angular_speed": { "type": "number" },
              "x": { "type": "string", "description": "Expresión paramétrica para x(t)" },
              "y": { "type": "string" },
              "z": { "type": "string" },
              "dt_mul": { "type": "number" },
              "angular_velocity": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "number" }, "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3 }
            },
            "required": ["type"]
          }
        },
        "required": ["object_id", "motion"]
      },
      "servers": ["python"],
      "category": "objects"
    },
    "move_linear": {
